Package: appclip-manager
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libsqlite3-0, libappindicator3-1, libnotify4
Maintainer: Jeyaul Hoque <contact@jeyaulhoque.pages.dev>
Homepage: https://jeyaulhoque.pages.dev/
Description: Manage installed apps and clipboard history on Ubuntu
 AppClip Manager lets you view and uninstall installed applications
 (APT, Snap, Flatpak), check for and install app updates, clean up
 orphaned config/cache files after uninstalling, start automatically
 on login, and keeps a searchable history of everything you copy to
 the clipboard with a full text/image detail viewer, copy, and save
 support.
